{"3620610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Primal Survival", "steam_appid": 3620610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/ddb73e171cf262be18a47cdddb216794.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1560 height=763 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Us On Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.mp4?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AT THE FIRST SPARK OF HUMANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the dawn of human history. It is an age when fire has just been discovered, language is beginning to form, and every breath is a struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Primal Survival</strong>, you are not always the hunter; most of the time, you are the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you back roughly 2.5–3 million years, into a wild world filled with life from mammoths and crocodiles to birds and small rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, adapt, and experience the era when early humans first discovered fire, tools, and thought itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution begins here. Survival is the first instinct of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILDLIFE &amp; ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predators stalk, prey flees, and the world breathes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of species coexist within this ecosystem. Some hunt you, others run from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mammoths migrate, crocodiles guard rivers, birds take flight, and rodents scatter in panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently; in this world, life and death constantly shift places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIBES AND EARLY SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own tribe or encounter others. Trade, fight, or unite to survive against the harshness of nature. Primitive communication and early belief systems form the foundation of human culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNTING AND TAMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt with primitive weapons, set traps, or drive your prey off cliffs. The ways of survival depend on your creativity. As you endure, your intelligence grows; you discover new recipes, abilities, knowledge, and learn to tame animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEATHER AND TEMPERATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic snowstorms, sandstorms, and heatwaves. Warm yourself by the fire, seek shelter from the rain, and endure the scorching sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open-world map set in prehistoric Africa<br>• Animal intelligence and a living ecosystem<br>• Realistic survival systems (hunger, thirst, fatigue, temperature)<br>• Day/night and weather cycles<br>• Crafting, building, and shelter systems<br>• Early tribe interactions and trading<br>• Primitive language and communication system<br>• Blood, damage, and wound mechanics<br>• Evolving intelligence and character progression</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADMAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest</strong>: Q4 2025<br><strong>Steam Next Fest Demo</strong>: February 23 – March 2, 2026<br><strong>Early Access</strong>: Q3–Q4 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/3c112ff1b16937780592d647352a8d1d.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AT THE FIRST SPARK OF HUMANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the dawn of human history. It is an age when fire has just been discovered, language is beginning to form, and every breath is a struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Primal Survival</strong>, you are not always the hunter; most of the time, you are the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you back roughly 2.5–3 million years, into a wild world filled with life from mammoths and crocodiles to birds and small rodents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, adapt, and experience the era when early humans first discovered fire, tools, and thought itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution begins here. Survival is the first instinct of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/e4c771acd429217adb991f5c166ad060.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILDLIFE &amp; ECOSYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predators stalk, prey flees, and the world breathes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of species coexist within this ecosystem. Some hunt you, others run from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mammoths migrate, crocodiles guard rivers, birds take flight, and rodents scatter in panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently; in this world, life and death constantly shift places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/94af95c4565973c1e25fb0b62b76bc25.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRIBES AND EARLY SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own tribe or encounter others. Trade, fight, or unite to survive against the harshness of nature. Primitive communication and early belief systems form the foundation of human culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/4a8815c085c531997f9693ef01b12940.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNTING AND TAMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt with primitive weapons, set traps, or drive your prey off cliffs. The ways of survival depend on your creativity. As you endure, your intelligence grows; you discover new recipes, abilities, knowledge, and learn to tame animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.poster.avif?t=1787053023\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/18b4a5da9800c134804b92da2f10c431.webm?t=1787053023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEATHER AND TEMPERATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic snowstorms, sandstorms, and heatwaves. Warm yourself by the fire, seek shelter from the rain, and endure the scorching sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open-world map set in prehistoric Africa<br>• Animal intelligence and a living ecosystem<br>• Realistic survival systems (hunger, thirst, fatigue, temperature)<br>• Day/night and weather cycles<br>• Crafting, building, and shelter systems<br>• Early tribe interactions and trading<br>• Primitive language and communication system<br>• Blood, damage, and wound mechanics<br>• Evolving intelligence and character progression</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROADMAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtest</strong>: Q4 2025<br><strong>Steam Next Fest Demo</strong>: February 23 – March 2, 2026<br><strong>Early Access</strong>: Q3–Q4 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A realistic prehistoric survival game where you play as Homo habilis or Homo erectus. Craft primitive tools, build shelter, hunt massive beasts, and survive the harsh forces of nature in a vast multiplayer world.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Turkish, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian, Czech, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/e05f762555f4fc6eb5bc95e43498ffb3ef7592c8/header.jpg?t=1787053023", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/866b416c5936b3ee2c878a1a9190e7f669f34dfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787053023", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/866b416c5936b3ee2c878a1a9190e7f669f34dfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787053023", "website": "https://primalsurvivalgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li